      "text": "As per the prosecution story, the informant alleged that she went to her friend's house and as her friend was not at her home, was returning when the accused persons forcibly took her away and there is allegation of committing rape one by one.\nConsidering the kind of allegation that has come against the petitioner, this Court is not inclined to extend him Patna High Court CR.",
